{
  "assessment": "The economic indicators remain stable with steady growth, and our security posture within the country is well-maintained under the ruling military council. With Mali affirming our alliance cooperation, we will formalize our joint regional stance within the Alliance of Sahel States. I will propose an alliance with Burkina Faso as well to consolidate the Sahel security architecture.",
  "directives": [
    {
      "type": "alliance_propose",
      "target": "BFA",
      "amount": 0,
      "order": "Propose a formal alliance with Burkina Faso to strengthen the Alliance of Sahel States."
    }
  ],
  "cables": [
    {
      "to": "MLI",
      "private": false,
      "text": "The Republic of Niger welcomes the solidarity and enduring brotherhood of Mali. Together within the Alliance of Sahel States, we will secure our nations and forge a prosperous future free from external dictation."
    }
  ],
  "public_statement": "The Government of the Republic of Niger reaffirms its steadfast commitment to national sovereignty, security, and the ideals of the Alliance of Sahel States. Working hand in hand with our regional allies, we will continue to safeguard our people and build the foundations of a resilient and independent economy.",
